{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1787923465, "idle_time_limit": 4.0, "env": {}, "title": "scanr — 5. Through a SOCKS5 proxy, and ssh -D"}
[0.011964, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2;36m# Through a proxy the proxy decides what closed means. transport test measures\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.41364, "o", "\u001b[2;36m# it: a known-open, a known-closed and a blackholed destination, and what came back.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
